## 1. **Pod Not Ready Alert** (UI Not Serving Traffic)

### ✅ Main Query

```prometheus
kube_pod_container_status_ready{
  cluster_name="azure-eastus-st-085-np-aks-001",
  namespace="storefront-storefront-ut",
  pod=~"mobility-ops-storefront-poc-ut-.*"
} == 0
```

> Checks if any container in the UI pod is **not ready**.

### 🚨 Alert Rule

| Setting           | Value               |
| ----------------- | ------------------- |
| **Expression**    | Use above query (A) |
| **Reduce**        | `Max`               |
| **Threshold**     | `IS ABOVE 0`        |
| **Eval Interval** | `3m`                |
| **Pending**       | `1m`                |
| **Severity**      | `critical`          |

### 📝 Description

```yaml
summary: "UI pod is not ready"
description: |
  The UI pod `mobility-ops-storefront-poc-ut` is not passing readiness checks and may not be serving traffic. 
  Investigate probe status, container logs, or startup delays.
```

