## 2. **Pod Restart Alert** (Possible Crash or Instability)

### ✅ Main Query

```prometheus
increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{
  cluster_name="azure-eastus-st-085-np-aks-001",
  namespace="storefront-storefront-ut",
  pod=~"mobility-ops-storefront-poc-ut-.*"
}[5m])
```

### 🚨 Alert Rule

* Same setup as before: `Reduce: Max`, `Threshold > 0`, `Eval: 3m`, `Pending: 1m`

### 📝 Description

```yaml
summary: "UI pod has restarted"
description: |
  The UI pod `mobility-ops-storefront-poc-ut` has restarted in the last 5 minutes.
  This could indicate container crashes, OOMKills, or failed probes. Check logs for root cause.
```

